Edit a blog post:


- Get the id of the blog post ✅
- Filter the blog posts in the db with that ID ✅
- If no blog post is found: ✅
    - return "Not Found" ✅
- Get the first blog post from the filtered blog posts ✅
- Use the BlogForm(instance=blog_post) ✅
- Listen to whether the user submit a form ✅
    - Write BlogForm(request.POST, instance=blog_post) ✅
    - If form valid: ✅
        - Save the form and redirect ✅
- Display the page 
------------------------
def edit_post(request, pk):

    blog_posts = Blog.objects.filter(id=pk)

    if not blog_posts:
        return HttpResponse("Not found")
    
    first_blog = blog_posts.first()

    form = BlogForm(instance=first_blog)

    if request.method == 'POST':
        first_blog.delete()
    
    return render(request, 'app_folder/edit.html', context={"form": form})



